+<summary>Issues (4)</summary>
+
+1. **Target GPU acceptance pending (medium, confirmed, non-blocking)** — CPU/AST/fake checks cannot establish checkpoint 8→7 behavior under PyTorch/NCCL/Project Pactum. Run the documented two-phase acceptance before advancing BUG-011 to `已验证`.
+2. **Production P2P path is not a checked-in regression (medium, confirmed, non-blocking)** — Current tests exercise helpers and AST shape but never execute old/async exception wrappers. Add the review's fake production-function cases or strengthen AST/dispatch assertions.
+3. **Ready-error diagnostic can escape (low, confirmed, non-blocking)** — A failing `print(..., flush=True)` after a caught handler write raises a new exception. Guard the diagnostic and test a broken output sink to make notification fully best-effort.
